e left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"> Dexterity +3</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more nimble and dexterous, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Dexterity.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Steady_Handed_Armbands.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Steady_Handed_Armbands.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"284\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>These leather bands aren't too spectacular looking, but when you put them on, it is almost as if your arms are weightless.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817230542\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.113 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3001/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18711/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3896/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n134.78%  130.345     38 Template:IO\n100.00%   96.712      1 -total\n 94.32%   91.222      1 Template:Named_item\n 89.67%   86.722